{"assets":["/statement-assets/6f15ad7cad068cbe340a002eaa9c87230cd12cf828b8cc98913cd22e8486700a.png","/statement-assets/7703303a0e050b5e072fec6c6d1af694ec43515b2de9151ffc7fda6d96ce3299.png","/statement-assets/746ab769a75256c97efa0f78571cac54ffa9bfbb1a9eab3db2bc29d680ccd3a7.png","/statement-assets/b9864e1067084923191074425e8782c0ea662b2fc3f9b0a006045e17644e4fdc.png","/statement-assets/ac294ee516a934b5ab50af7c6329ae47bab9fb56e201e00e85185ac6467e075d.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"786","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Rap God"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"7 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Rick is in love with Unity. But Mr. Meeseeks also love Unity, so Rick and Mr. Meeseeks are \"love rivals\". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Unity loves rap, so it decided that they have to compete in a rap game (battle) in order to choose the best. Rick is too nerds, so instead he's gonna make his verse with running his original algorithm on lyrics \"Rap God\" song."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/6f15ad7cad068cbe340a002eaa9c87230cd12cf828b8cc98913cd22e8486700a.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"His algorithm is a little bit complicated. He's made a tree with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" vertices numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and there's a lowercase english letter written on each edge. He denotes "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"str(a, b)"},{"kind":"text","text":" to be the string made by writing characters on edges on the shortest path from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" one by one (a string of length equal to distance of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Note that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"str(a, b)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is reverse of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"str(b, a)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"str(a, a)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is empty."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In order to make the best verse he can, he needs to answer some queries, but he's not a computer scientist and is not able to answer those queries, so he asked you to help him. Each query is characterized by two vertices "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x ≠ y"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Answer to this query is the number of vertices like "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"z"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"z ≠ x, z ≠ y"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"str(x, y)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is lexicographically larger than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"str(x, z)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"String "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x  =  x1x2...x|x|"},{"kind":"text","text":" is lexicographically larger than string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y  =  y1y2...y|y|"},{"kind":"text","text":", if either "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|x|  >  |y|"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1  =  y1,  x2  =  y2,  ...,  x|y|  =  y|y|"},{"kind":"text","text":", or exists such number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r (r  <  |x|,  r  <  |y|)"},{"kind":"text","text":", that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1  =  y1,  x2  =  y2,  ...,  xr  =  yr"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"xr  +  1  >  yr  +  1"},{"kind":"text","text":". Characters are compared like their ASCII codes (or alphabetic order)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Rick get the girl (or whatever gender Unity has)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contain two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 20000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ q ≤ 20000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — number of vertices in tree and number of queries respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain the edges. Each line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":" (endpoints of the edge) followed by an English lowercase letter "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ v, u ≤ n, v ≠ u"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" line contain the queries. Each line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ x, y ≤ n, x ≠ y"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the answer for each query in one line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3\n4 1 t\n3 2 p\n1 2 s\n3 2\n1 3\n2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n1\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8 4\n4 6 p\n3 7 o\n7 8 p\n4 5 d\n1 3 o\n4 3 p\n3 2 e\n8 6\n3 7\n8 1\n4 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n1\n3\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here's the tree of first sample testcase:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/7703303a0e050b5e072fec6c6d1af694ec43515b2de9151ffc7fda6d96ce3299.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here's the tree of second sample testcase:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},